      "content": "\"stop fighting at all\"... that's heavy. It feels like there's a certain kind of peace in that idea, like if I just stopped trying to hold everything together, the weight would finally lift. Like the struggle is just a burden I've been carrying for no reason. What do you mean by \"letting go of the fight\"? Is that... is that a way to find that peace?",
